Package: OncoclassfieR
Type: Package
Title: Jaccard Similarity Based Sample Classification for Cancer MAF Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("OncoclassfieR", "Authors", email = "your.email@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Classifies tumour samples into molecular subgroups based on
    the Jaccard similarity of their mutation profiles, as implemented in the
    LCBM/HSYY panel analysis pipeline.  The package pre-processes MAF
    objects, computes pairwise Jaccard similarity matrices, performs
    hierarchical clustering, re-draws the similarity heatmap in a given
    subgroup order, and provides helpers for per-cluster gene ranking, pie
    charts, oncoplots, TMB comparison and survival analysis.
